    ],
    "nom_orig": "Ms.[SP]Ideal",
    "texte_orig": "I'm[SP]not[SP]afraid[SP]to[SP]die[SP]to[SP]prove[SP]his[SP]research\nwas[SP]true![SP]I[SP]was[SP]worthier[SP]to[SP]be[SP]his[SP]wife\nthan[SP]that[SP]shrew!",
